.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt PROCESS_EXECUTABLE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm process_executable
.Nd get the path of the current executable
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In process.h
.Ft char *
.Fn process_executable "void"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn process_executable
function retrieves the absolute path of the currently running executable.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns a pointer to a string containing the executable path, or
.Dv NULL
on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr process_create 3